# Line totals and a tax rate chosen from the region.

An Line has a sku which is a string, a price which is a decimal, and a quantity which is an integer

An Invoice has a region which is a string and lines which are a list of Line

To LineTotal, given a line which is a Line, returning a decimal
    return the price of the line times the quantity of the line

To TaxRate, given a region which is a string, returning a decimal
    the rate is 0.05
    switch on the region
        when "east"
            the rate is 0.08
        when "west"
            the rate is 0.07
    return the rate
